<!--
    file        : career-elite.xml
    description : Elite Career Series - 8-round top-level championship.
                  The player races against 7 of the best AI opponents across
                  8 challenging circuits.  Reach this tier by winning the
                  Pro Series championship.  The Elite Series is the pinnacle
                  of the career ladder.
-->

